n\" class=\"pt-twisty\" data-action=\"world-toggle\" aria-expanded=\"true\"\n         aria-label=\"Collapse this branch\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n      </button>\n      <img class=\"pt-attr-icon\" src=\"icons/environment/settlement/city-night.webp\" alt=\"\">\n      <span class=\"pt-attr-title\">Vel</span>\n      <span class=\"pt-attr-category\">City</span>\n      \n      <span class=\"pt-world-count\" data-tooltip=\"How much of what is under here they have been told.\">1/1</span>\n      \n    </div>\n    <ul class=\"pt-world-branch\"><li class=\"pt-world-node pt-state-known\" data-id=\"guild\"\n      data-state=\"known\">\n    <div class=\"pt-world-row\">\n      <span class=\"pt-twisty pt-twisty-leaf\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <img class=\"pt-attr-icon\" src=\"icons/sundries/flags/banner-standard-green.webp\" alt=\"\">\n      <span class=\"pt-attr-title\">Salt Guild</span>\n      <span class=\"pt-attr-category\">Guild</span>\n      \n      \n      \n    </div>\n    \n  </li></ul>\n  </li></ul>\n    <div class=\"pt-add-bar pt-attr-add pt-grant-control\" data-character=\"zzPc000000000001\">\n    <div class=\"pt-inbound-head\">\n      <span class=\"pt-inbound-title\">Tell them about something</span>\n      <span class=\"pt-gm-badge\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-eye-slash\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> GM only</span>\n    </div>\n    <input type=\"search\" class=\"pt-attr-search pt-grant-search\"\n           placeholder=\"Something they have learned, or a new name to create…\"\n           aria-label=\"Something they have learned, or a new name to create…\">\n    <label class=\"pt-field pt-field-check\">\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"pt-grant-parents\">\n      <span>Also tell them everything it belongs to</span>\n    </label>\n    <p class=\"pt-hint\">Off by default: they get exactly what you name. Told about a guild but not its city, they know it exists and still cannot spot a member — turn this on when you meant them to start recognising people.</p>\n    <div class=\"pt-attr-results pt-grant-results\" hidden></div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n  </div>"
